# Astro patterns

- `output: 'static'` — all Strapi fetches at build time in frontmatter / `getStaticPaths`
- Strapi content via `src/lib/strapi/` — always pass `locale` explicitly
- Mock data when `USE_MOCK_DATA=true` or Strapi not configured
- React islands only when interactivity is required (not yet used)
- Monorepo layout: frontend in `apps/web`, CMS in `apps/cms`, brand in `packages/brand`
- See `docs/decisions/006-monorepo-apps-layout.md`
